Raw result: {"response":"**Returns**\n================\n\nIf you need to return an item, our return policy is as follows:\n\n### Eligibility for Returns\n\nReturns are accepted within 7 days of delivery for unopened items. Please review our return policy for full details.\n\n### Refund Process\n\nRefunds are processed once the returned item is received and inspected. The amount will be credited back to your original payment method within 5-7 business days.\n\n### Return Shipping Costs\n\nYes, if the return is due to damage or an error on our part, we cover shipping costs. For other reasons, customers are responsible for return shipping.\n\n### Exchanges\n\nYes, exchanges are possible if the item is in stock. Contact support to initiate an exchange request.\n\n### Damaged Items\n\nIf your item arrives damaged, contact support within 48 hours with photos of the product. We will arrange a replacement or refund promptly.\n\n### Contacting Support\n\nTo initiate a return, exchange, or to report a damaged item, please contact us at support@snacksonline.com or using our phone number with your order number.\n\n### Cancellation of Orders\n\nYou can cancel an order within 2 hours of placing it by visiting your order history page. After this window, the order may already be processed, but you can still contact support to check if cancellation is possible.\n\n### References\n\n### References\n\n* [1] Can I return an item?\n* [2] Refunds are processed once the returned item is received and inspected.\n* [3] Return Shipping Costs\n* [4] Do you cover return shipping costs?\n* [5] How do I get a refund?","references":[]}

